\par\par \b \uc2 Glencore Restructures, Making a Bet on Copper\b0\par\par\uc2 By Adam Whittaker \par \uc2 286 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 December 2025\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B2\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2025 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Glencore\uc2  cut around 1,000 jobs as part of a restructuring that bets big on growing copper demand.\par \par \uc2 The commodities giant said it would invest heavily to increase copper production to around 1.6 million metric tons a year by 2035 as part of its goal of becoming one of the world's biggest copper miners. \uc2 Glencore\uc2  produced around 950,000 tons of the industrial metal last year.\par \par \uc2 Copper prices have rallied this year, with technology companies investing heavily in data centers. The metal is a core component in wiring and will be central to global electrification efforts.\par \par \uc2 Under the new structure, \uc2 Glencore\uc2 's nickel and zinc operations have been merged, while the company has created additional divisions covering Argentine capital projects and special projects.\par \par \uc2 Partly due to challenges at its Collahuasi mine in Chile, the company lowered the midpoint of its 2026 output guidance to 840,000 tons from 930,000 tons. Analysts had expected that guidance to fall.\par \par \uc2 The roughly 1,000 job cuts hadn't previously been disclosed. The Switzerland-based company has about 150,000 employees worldwide.\par \par \uc2 However, \uc2 Glencore\uc2  had said in August that it was targeting around $1 billion in cost savings by the end of 2026 following a review of its assets.\par \par \uc2 Argentina will play a central role in delivering \uc2 Glencore\uc2 's copper ambitions. The company said Wednesday that it would restart its Alumbrera copper mine in northern Argentina in the fourth quarter of 2026, and aims for production to begin in the first half of 2028. The country is also home to the miner's El Pachon and Agua Rica copper projects.\par \par \uc2 London-listed \uc2 Glencore\uc2  shares rose 6.3%.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020251204elc40000z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
